        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Bennet, Lola Dee, the man called \"The Father of Rock and Roll\"\n- Titles and Labels: \"The Father of Rock and Roll\", \"Junior Junction\"\n- Topics: touring, auditions, recording contracts\n\nFacts:\n- Tony Bennet called a man \"The Father of Rock and Roll.\"\n- Lola Dee once auditioned for \"Junior Junction.\"\n- Lola Dee landed a recording contract in her teens.\n- The man Tony Bennet called \"The Father of Rock and Roll\" once toured with Lola Dee.",
